WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.635
-The impeachment inquiry

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.869
in the House rolls on.

00:00:03.869 --> 00:00:06.673
In today's docket,
there was testimony provided

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.275
by Lieutenant Colonel
Alexander Vindman...

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:17.650
Pretty solid witness, right?

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.686
Well, turns out, that depends
on whom you ask.

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.889 line:0%
-Get this. This is buried
in The New York Times

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.957
piece tonight,
but I found it very interesting.

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:28.595
"Because [Colonel Vindman]
emigrated from Ukraine,

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.863
along with his family
when he was a child

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:33.766
and is fluent in Ukrainian
and Russian,

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:36.569
Ukrainian officials
sought advice from him

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:39.105
about how to deal
with Mr. Giuliani,

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.673
though they typi-cal-ly

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.942
[laughing]
communicated in English"!

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:47.713
Here we have a U.S.
national security official

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:53.686
who is advising Ukraine while
working inside the White House,

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:56.356
apparently against
the president's interests,

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:59.292
and, usually,
they spoke in English.

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:01.327
Isn't that kind of
an interesting angle

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.495
on this story?

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.864
-This bring us to a segment
we call "Hey!"

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:08.434
[ Upbeat suspenseful theme ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.536
Hey!
[ Whistling ]

00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:13.973
Laura Ingraham, you're
attacking a decorated veteran

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.175
to protect Donald Trump?
Who do you think you are,

00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:17.443
Donald Trump?

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.178
[ Laughter ]
And, by the way, yes,

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:22.148
Colonel Vindman emigrated
from Ukraine when he was three.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:25.184
Nobody even remembers where they
were when they were three,

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:27.020
with the possible
exception of you.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.888
I'm sure, when you were three,
you were already

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:31.758
at Saks Fifth Avenue,
makin' a salesperson cry.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.460
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.627
And, hey, do you really
think it's smart

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.396
to attack veterans on Fox News?

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:38.564
Veterans make up a pretty good
chunk of your audience.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:40.333
I think it goes veterans,

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:42.468
people visiting
their elderly relatives,

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:45.104
and rage-aholic golfers
age 73 and up.

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:47.073
[ Laughter ]
But, hey!

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:48.174
At least you weren't alone.

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.909
A CNN contributor
named Sean Duffy

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.410
got in on the action as well.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:56.081
-Mr. Vindman, he's an advisor
to the president.

00:01:56.081 --> 00:01:57.549
He is a former Ukrainian.

00:01:57.549 --> 00:01:59.152
He wants to make sure
the taxpayer money goes

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:00.853
in military aid to the Ukraine.
-I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:02.789
Why does it matter? Why does
it matter where he was born?

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.257
I'm sorry, Congressman Duffy,
why does it matter

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.291
where he was born?
-I'm going to explain that

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.292
to you.
-That came up on Fox News.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.661
He's an active duty
military member,

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.562
an American who was awarded
the Purple Heart.

00:02:10.562 --> 00:02:14.233
-It seems very clear
that he is incredibly concerned

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:16.068
about Ukrainian defense.

00:02:16.068 --> 00:02:18.004
I don't know that he's concerned
about American policy,

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.772
but his main mission was
to make sure

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.373
that the Ukraine got
those weapons.

00:02:21.373 --> 00:02:23.409
-Oh, hey! Sean Duffy,

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:25.544
you don't know about his concern
for American policy?

00:02:25.544 --> 00:02:27.446
He got a Purple Heart
fighting for America.

00:02:27.446 --> 00:02:29.983
You were -- and this is true,
this is seriously true --

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:32.785
a cast member
on "The Real World: Boston."

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.120
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.656
And, by the way,
"The Real World: Boston"

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:39.191
is the biggest oxymoron
I have ever heard.

00:02:39.191 --> 00:02:41.661
[ Laughter ]
Boston isn't the real world.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:44.997
It's like Colonial Williamsburg
with fistfights.

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:46.632
[ Fresh laughter ]
And, hey!

00:02:46.632 --> 00:02:47.967
You guys think
he's putting Ukraine

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:49.769
over America
because he speaks Ukrainian?

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:51.837
It might actually be helpful
to speak the language

00:02:51.837 --> 00:02:53.439
of the nation
you're dealing with.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:55.574
Imagine how much better things
would be doin' here

00:02:55.574 --> 00:02:57.410
if this guy spoke English.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.078
[ Laughter ]
And, hey, CNN!

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:01.347
Why are you having
Sean Duffy on, anyway?

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:04.016
From now on, anytime you have
someone from a reality show

00:03:04.016 --> 00:03:07.420
on CNN, someone from CNN has
to go on a reality show.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:10.290
Let's see how Wolf Blitzer
does on "Love Island."

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.893
[ Laughter and applause ]
He'd probably --

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:18.864
[ Cheering and applause ]
If we're being honest --

00:03:18.864 --> 00:03:19.899
I bet he'd do pretty well.

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.300
[English accent]
"I like your beard.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.735
Your beard matches your face.

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:25.104
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:26.105
Your first name's Wolf?

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:27.373
I like that."

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:28.374
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:29.608
This has been "Hey!"

00:03:29.608 --> 00:03:32.745
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

